      "writtenOn": "2025-03-04T23:22:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It fails because Makefile.modfinal manually filters out $(CFLAGS_KCSAN), which includes -mllvm, leaving -improved-fs-discriminator\u003dtrue unrecognized. It is fixed by backporting https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/kernel/common/+/3525112.",
