      "writtenOn": "2025-03-04T23:22:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This config was added by default in android16-6.12, in https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/kernel/common/+/3404523.\nFor kernel 6.6, since it is already released and we want to minimize the impact on the default build, this config is only added to the AUTOFDO build. For the place to add, common/android is all about exported symbols, while common/arch/arm64/config contains several *_gki.fragment files. So I feel common/arch/arm64/config is more suitable.",
